#     real_minus_legacy  -23.4 [-429.1, +382.3]
#     real_minus_shuffle +6.8 [-86.3, +99.9]
#     wf-out has 2 season-clusters, so 1 degrees of freedom
#     and a t quantile of 12.7. Those intervals are too wide
#     to resolve anything and are printed as a limit, not as
#     a result. Five seasons cannot be split any better.
#   an effect present in-sample and absent out-of-sample is
#   the signature of overfitting. Both are printed so nobody
#   has to remember to look.
